{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set sail for chaos in <strong><i>Ocean Survivors</i></strong>\u2014a fast-paced, naval-combat roguelite where the seas are as deadly as they are bountiful. Take command of your pirate ship and engage in thrilling top-down battles against relentless waves of enemy ships. Dodge cannon fire, unleash devastating attacks, and plunder their treasure to forge your legend as the fiercest pirate captain! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501520/extras/High_Action_Gameplay.gif?t=1740426714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wreak Havoc:</strong> Combining your skills with acquired abilities, steer the ultimate pirate ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501520/extras/Level_Up.gif?t=1740426714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrading Your Ship:</strong> Collect enough XP to level up and make your ship stronger and stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501520/extras/Abilities.gif?t=1740426714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Abilities:</strong> Unlock 3 out of many abilities that are available each run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score Attack:</strong> Gather as much loot as you can until the timer runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboard:</strong> Compare your loot with other pirates to see who truly is the king of the seas!<strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501520?t=1740426714","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501520?t=17404